{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32337","headline":"李先生别墅望僧舍宝刹因作双韵声 · 温庭筠","name":"李先生别墅望僧舍宝刹因作双韵声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖息消心象，檐楹溢艳阳。\n帘栊兰露落，邻里柳林凉。\n高阁过空谷，孤竿隔古冈。\n潭庐同淡荡，髣髴复芬芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}